    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Exterminate menacing creatures!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The year is 2050. Humans have been forced to flee Earth and colonize Mars! Now it\u2019s up to you to exterminate hordes of aggressive local creatures so your kind can settle on the planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overpowered 1 - Mars Infestation is an action-packed survival shooter presented in fluidly animated pixel art style! Step into the boots of a spacefaring soldier as you tackle 4 intense story missions, each with multiple objectives and levels to master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722150/extras/746422941ab448313e52c354fd21b86b.poster.avif?t=1751359240\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722150/extras/746422941ab448313e52c354fd21b86b.webm?t=1751359240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722150/extras/746422941ab448313e52c354fd21b86b.mp4?t=1751359240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use intuitive twin-stick controls to move around top-down environments with determination and speed while gunning down all incoming threats. Collect power-ups to upgrade your weapons on the fly! The faster you take down enemies, the higher your score will climb, allowing you to challenge leaderboards in survival mode. How long can you stay in the fight?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722150/extras/9af36a7fb21054104be6d94ab436135f.poster.avif?t=1751359240\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722150/extras/9af36a7fb21054104be6d94ab436135f.webm?t=1751359240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722150/extras/9af36a7fb21054104be6d94ab436135f.mp4?t=1751359240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exterminate waves of incoming enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run, evade, aim and fire with intuitive twin-stick controls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on 4 story missions, each with multiple objectives!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge online leaderboards in survival mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy retro pixel art aesthetics and a pumping soundtrack!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Exterminate menacing creatures!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The year is 2050. Humans have been forced to flee Earth and colonize Mars! Now it\u2019s up to you to exterminate hordes of aggressive local creatures so your kind can settle on the planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overpowered 1 - Mars Infestation is an action-packed survival shooter presented in fluidly animated pixel art style! Step into the boots of a spacefaring soldier as you tackle 4 intense story missions, each with multiple objectives and levels to master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722150/extras/746422941ab448313e52c354fd21b86b.poster.avif?t=1751359240\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722150/extras/746422941ab448313e52c354fd21b86b.webm?t=1751359240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722150/extras/746422941ab448313e52c354fd21b86b.mp4?t=1751359240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use intuitive twin-stick controls to move around top-down environments with determination and speed while gunning down all incoming threats. Collect power-ups to upgrade your weapons on the fly! The faster you take down enemies, the higher your score will climb, allowing you to challenge leaderboards in survival mode. How long can you stay in the fight?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722150/extras/9af36a7fb21054104be6d94ab436135f.poster.avif?t=1751359240\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722150/extras/9af36a7fb21054104be6d94ab436135f.webm?t=1751359240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722150/extras/9af36a7fb21054104be6d94ab436135f.mp4?t=1751359240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exterminate waves of incoming enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run, evade, aim and fire with intuitive twin-stick controls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on 4 story missions, each with multiple objectives!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge online leaderboards in survival mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy retro pixel art aesthetics and a pumping soundtrack!</p></li></ul>",
